Description: Fits hierarchical signal detection theory (SDT) models to paired
    awareness and influence measures in research on unconscious processing.
    Estimates mean sensitivities, their latent correlation and influence
    sensitivity at zero awareness sensitivity, using maximum likelihood with
    'lme4' or Bayesian inference with 'brms'. Provides Bayes factors, equivalence
    tests, reliability estimates and study planning for power, precision and cost.
